\f1\fs22 \'93It was in the bottled water, some sort of synthetic ebola-like poison. Anyone who drank the bottled water will be very unwell.\'94 Professor Hermann reported to cabinet that same afternoon. \'93It\'92s safe to say your army of Dawks have been compromised.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93We cannot trust any of them\'94 The High Elvis concluded. \'93We are on our own. Will our Elvi survive?\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93I have never seen any agent so diabolical. Any average human or clone for that matter, would die within hours of ingestion. Our Elvi are being afforded protection by the Hybrid T-virus (\cf3 find the actual name of the virus)\cf2  and I am confident they can fight it off.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93This has left the us vulnerable and we must be given the time to regroup. We will not be able to repel any aggression with so many layed-low.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Well, what if we do die?\'94 Cracker, The Great Teacher, said.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93What do you mean?\'94 The High Elvis replied angrily. \'93 If we die, all is lost.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93I mean, what if we let it be known the Elvi are dying of some mystery illness? A cloning error, perhaps.\'94 The Great Teacher was met with blank looks. \'93They won\'92t need to finish us off if they think they have succeeded. Hopefully, by the time the PTD find out it was bullshit, the Elvi will have recovered.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Does any member of the cabinet have any better ideas?\'94 It was the High Elvis\'92 turn to be met with blank stares. \'93No? Let it be known that the Elvi are dying out, but first, let our Elvi brothers and sisters know of this ruse. We don\'92t need them to freak-out.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93We will have to make it look good. We will need mourning and wailing in the streets and funerals, plenty of funerals.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93No, mass graves and funeral pyres.\'94 The High Elvis had spoken.
